        `the direction`'s `given by an employment officer`
    AND (   `the direction`'s `with a view to assisting the claimant to find employment`
         OR `the direction`'s `with a view to improving the claimant's prospects of being employed`)

-- src:640 | (b) “training scheme“ and “employment programme” have such meaning as may be prescribed.
