-- src:650 | (b) either member of the couple was a member of another couple previously entitled to such an allowance and that couple ceased to be so entitled by that person failing to comply with the condition in section 1(2)(a) or (c).
@ref s 46 JSA 19B(3) (src:648-650)
GIVEN `the award is of a joint-claim jobseeker's allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the couple were previously entitled to a joint-claim allowance but ceased to be so entitled by either or both of them failing to comply with the condition in section 1(2)(a) or (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `either member was a member of another couple previously entitled, which ceased to be so entitled by that person failing to comply with the condition in section 1(2)(a) or (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 46 JSA 19B(3) regulations may provide for a reduction of the joint-claim award after an earlier joint claim` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF     `the award is of a joint-claim jobseeker's allowance`
           AND (   `the couple were previously entitled to a joint-claim allowance but ceased to be so entitled by either or both of them failing to comply with the condition in section 1(2)(a) or (c)`
                OR `either member was a member of another couple previously entitled, which ceased to be so entitled by that person failing to comply with the condition in section 1(2)(a) or (c)`)
