§ `s 46: the provision that reduces an award`

DECLARE `s 46 JSA section` IS ONE OF
    `s 46 JSA 19 higher-level sanctions`
    `s 46 JSA 19A other sanctions`
    `s 46 JSA 19B claimants ceasing to be available for employment`

-- Seam 9 of PLAN.md: the core's list of provisions that reduce an award; this part maps each section it inserts to one constructor.
-- src:582 | 19 Higher-level sanctions
-- src:601 | 19A Other sanctions
-- src:641 | 19B Claimants ceasing to be available for employment etc
@ref s 46 JSA 19, 19A and 19B (src:582 src:601 src:641)
GIVEN `the section` IS A `s 46 JSA section`
GIVETH A `Provision that reduces an award`
`s 46 JSA 19 to 19B the provision that reduces an award` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the section`
    WHEN `s 46 JSA 19 higher-level sanctions` THEN `jobseeker's allowance higher-level sanction`
    WHEN `s 46 JSA 19A other sanctions` THEN `jobseeker's allowance other sanction`
    WHEN `s 46 JSA 19B claimants ceasing to be available for employment` THEN `jobseeker's allowance ceasing to be available`

